    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABR8bcNw",
      "title": "sep/128: move the staging migrate anchor to Nov 25 12:00 UTC",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1651,
      "body": "Moves the sep/128 starting anchor from `1795551692` (Nov 24 20:21 UTC) to `1795608000` (Nov 25 12:00 UTC).\n\nThe shared supernode `dn-op-int-0-supernode-0` derives op-int-0 + uni-int-0 but its safe-head history starts on the morning of Nov 25, so `superroot_atTimestamp` at the old anchor fails (\"safedb history unavailable\"). The proposer and challenger need super roots from the anchor onward.\n\nNew anchor `0xa35b1bd1d9ed7d4ac558e3398ec8e12f7daf548a5282d066afbb176ece7c4082` (op-int-0 block 286494, uni-int-0 block 570684, both finalized). It matches the supernode's `superroot_atTimestamp(1795608000)` and an independent recomputation from the L2 RPCs.\n\nsep/128 message and Safe tx hashes and the calldata block are regenerated from the stacked simulation; sep/129 hashes are unchanged.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-25T21:06:44Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-25T21:26:39Z",
      "additions": 13,
      "deletions": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABR76R3w",
      "title": "docs: mark sep tasks 126-127 as EXECUTED",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1650,
      "body": "## Summary\n- Mark sep/126 and sep/127 as EXECUTED, linking the Sepolia transactions that ran the U22 staging OPCM upgrades.\n\n## Tasks\n- [sep/126](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops/blob/docs/mark-sep-126-127-executed/src/tasks/sep/126-U22-staging-devnet-2-3-op-uni-replica-opcm-upgrade-v1000/README.md) — devnet-2/3, stg-op-replica, stg-uni-replica: https://sepolia.etherscan.io/tx/0x224392242a5c734ed9d1685df8aa12230a0a9703f58122f58d253fdca19f6f16\n- [sep/127](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops/blob/docs/mark-sep-126-127-executed/src/tasks/sep/127-U22-staging-devnet-6-opcm-upgrade-v1000/README.md) — sepolia-devnet-6: https://sepolia.etherscan.io/tx/0x1a6c7e96627895566fe47c20235bb9121f5917a2fb8dc37568ec6d0b42b1f612\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Confirm each Sepolia tx is the staging ProxyAdminOwner execution for the matching task (correct Safe, correct calldata).\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
